.TH "DESTIN" "1" "Aug 07, 2026" "0.0.0" "destin"
.SH NAME
destin \- destin v0.0.0
.SH COMMAND REFERENCE
.sp
Every game is a sub\-group of the top\-level \fBdestin\fP command, so each tool is invoked as
\fBdestin <game> <subcommand>\fP\&. The full command tree below is generated from the CLI itself.
.sp
The \fI\%Usage\fP and \fI\%Utilities\fP pages cover the \fBdestin incoming\fP extractor in more detail.
.SS destin
.sp
Extract and convert assets from a collection of PC and console video games.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
destin [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
Options
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.UNINDENT
.SS amplitude
.sp
PS2 Amplitude and FreQuency (Harmonix) asset unpacker.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
destin amplitude [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SS main
.sp
Unpack a PS2 game directory (Amplitude or FreQuency) into OUT and convert its assets.
.sp
Every ARK found under GAME_DIR is unpacked into OUT mirroring its location (e.g.
\fBGEN/MAIN.ARK\fP \-> \fBOUT/GEN/MAIN/\fP), and disc streaming songs (\fBAUDIO/*.STR\fP) are
converted to WAV. The ARK format (Amplitude vs FreQuency) is auto\-detected. Assets are
converted in place: bitmaps to PNG, DataArray to JSON, Milo scenes to object folders, meshes
to OBJ, and audio streams/banks to WAV.
.SS Parameters
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B game_dir (pathlib.Path)
The game\(aqs root directory (the disc root) to scan for ARKs and disc audio.
.TP
.B out (pathlib.Path)
Output directory (created if missing).
.TP
.B jobs (int)
Worker processes for the CPU\-bound conversion phases (defaults to the CPU count).
.TP
.B no_convert (bool)
Extract raw assets without converting them.
.TP
.B no_gunzip (bool)
Extract \fB\&.gz\fP entries verbatim instead of decompressing them in place.
.TP
.B keep_gz (bool)
Keep the original \fB\&.gz\fP entry alongside the decompressed output.
.TP
.B ignore_failures (bool)
Log and skip a conversion failure instead of stopping the run.
.UNINDENT
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
destin amplitude main [OPTIONS] GAME_DIR OUT
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
