.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-l, \-\-list
List the archive members and exit.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output\-dir <output_dir>
Extract into this directory.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-p, \-\-password <password>
Password for an encrypted installer.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
