.sp
Textures and fonts become PNG, materials become JSON, and models become OBJ (plus a standalone
WebGL viewer). Use \fB\-\-raw\fP to skip all conversion, or the individual \fB\-\-no\-*\fP flags to
a specific conversion. GROUP is deleted afterwards unless \fB\-\-no\-delete\fP is given.
