.SS generate
.sp
Generate a fresh, fully\-unlocked \fBsave.bin\fP at OUT (from a zero\-initialised save).
.sp
Every regular song is unlocked unconditionally. DLC tokens are device\-bound
(\fBMD5(device_id + pack)\fP), so supply the target device\(aqs id via \fB\-\-device\-id\fP or copy it
from an existing save with \fB\-\-from\-save\fP; on iOS the id is always \fB\(dqiOS\(dq\fP\&. Songs do not
depend on the device id. The integrity hash is never verified on load, so the result loads
as\-is.
.sp
Usage
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
destin tonesphere save generate [OPTIONS] OUT
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.sp
