.SS unlock\-songs
.sp
Unlock every regular (non\-DLC) song in SAVE_PATH.
.sp
Sets the whole song unlock\-flag array, so every \fBUnlockNum\fP\-gated song becomes visible without
meeting its \fBCondChart\fP/\fBCondStar\fP condition. DLC episodes need device\-bound tokens instead;
use \fBunlock\-dlc\fP (or \fBunlock\-all\fP) for those.
